comments.body:
@participant19 I agree with @participant6 - same issue experienced (have to force quit to see other nodes). 

More importantly, I am also seeing odd behavior now with the exit node. There is no way for me to select my exit node now, and unlike before, there is no red banner message complaining that internet access is disabled without an exit node. So I can't get to the internet at all now while on the tailnet, and the only change was this cursed mobile app release.

I appreciate shipping software is not easy, but how did so many issue make it through this release? It would be nice if Tailscale did a bit more testing of their iOS app. 😕
